{"vid":"xEMqJ3rk-Qo","source":"xEMqJ3rk-Qo.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":3.4,"txt":"[JONATHAN RECKFORD] We are in an unprecedented period of change,"},{"t":6.5,"txt":"and really from all directions."},{"t":8.4,"txt":"And what we're seeing, whether you are a public"},{"t":10,"txt":"servant leader, private sector, or social sector,"},{"t":13.3,"txt":"the level of technological change is generational."},{"t":16.1,"txt":"This is a revolution."},{"t":17.7,"txt":"[JENNIFER BARRERA] Everybody's a little bit nervous right now."},{"t":19.6,"txt":"Businesses thrive on certainty."},{"t":21.3,"txt":"[SITHARA RASHEED] I don't think that it's important that leaders of"},{"t":24.1,"txt":"today need to have all of the answers, but it's important"},{"t":27.4,"txt":"that they ask right questions."},{"t":35.8,"txt":"[KEN SHOTTS] Part of the importance of the Stanford Leadership Institute"},{"t":39,"txt":"in a forum like today's event is people learning about specifics,"},{"t":44.1,"txt":"learning about particular issues, what is going on"},{"t":47.1,"txt":"right now, how to approach specific problems that they"},{"t":51.1,"txt":"or their organizations may face"},{"t":53.5,"txt":"[CONDOLEEZZA RICE] The international system has evolved into one in"},{"t":56.9,"txt":"which particularly the world of technology,"},{"t":59.1,"txt":"but also the international economy are more competitive,"},{"t":63.5,"txt":"adversarial, decoupling than at any other time."},{"t":67.9,"txt":"[KEN SHOTTS] Not only do companies need to be more flexible and resilient,"},{"t":71.1,"txt":"but our workforce needs to be more flexible and resilient."},{"t":75.4,"txt":"You think you just finished business school, you think"},{"t":77.8,"txt":"you just finished college, you think you just finished"},{"t":80.3,"txt":"the journey of learning?"},{"t":82.7,"txt":"You have just started."},{"t":85.8,"txt":"[AMIT SERU] Learning means also having the right judgment to fight"},{"t":89.7,"txt":"the uncertainty and be able to still succeed."},{"t":92.8,"txt":"[MATTEO MAGGIORI] We need a set of leaders that understand that what they're"},{"t":95.3,"txt":"doing is going to have vast impacts and value society"},{"t":98.4,"txt":"and the value for everybody over a long period of time."},{"t":101.5,"txt":"[MICHELE GELFAND] That's really in the spirit of Stanford Leadership Institute,"},{"t":103.8,"txt":"is to bring people together."},{"t":105.7,"txt":"Like today, people from government,"},{"t":107.1,"txt":"from industry, from academia, in a shared space where we"},{"t":110.7,"txt":"can explore issues together."},{"t":112.2,"txt":"[CONDOLEEZZA RICE] There has never been a more important link"},{"t":113.8,"txt":"between the private sector and national security and"},{"t":116.4,"txt":"the health of the country and the health of American"},{"t":119.2,"txt":"power than at this moment."},{"t":120.7,"txt":"[RISHI SUNAK] We're living through this incredible moment,"},{"t":122.6,"txt":"and I have the ability, I have agency to shape"},{"t":126,"txt":"Our destiny."},{"t":127,"txt":"[SITHARA RASHEED] The leaders that will matter the most are the"},{"t":129.2,"txt":"ones that are willing to say, \"Here's what I believe in,"},{"t":132.8,"txt":"and I'm willing to be accountable to it.\""}],"words":[{"t":3.36,"w":"[JONATHAN"},{"t":3.36,"w":"RECKFORD]"},{"t":3.36,"w":"We"},{"t":3.36,"w":"are"},{"t":3.36,"w":"in"},{"t":3.36,"w":"an"},{"t":3.36,"w":"unprecedented"},{"t":3.36,"w":"period"},{"t":3.36,"w":"of"},{"t":3.36,"w":"change,"},{"t":6.46,"w":"and"},{"t":6.46,"w":"really"},{"t":6.46,"w":"from"},{"t":6.46,"w":"all"},{"t":6.46,"w":"directions."},{"t":8.4,"w":"And"},{"t":8.4,"w":"what"},{"t":8.4,"w":"we're"},{"t":8.4,"w":"seeing,"},{"t":8.4,"w":"whether"},{"t":8.4,"w":"you"},{"t":8.4,"w":"are"},{"t":8.4,"w":"a"},{"t":8.4,"w":"public"},{"t":10.02,"w":"servant"},{"t":10.02,"w":"leader,"},{"t":10.02,"w":"private"},{"t":10.02,"w":"sector,"},{"t":10.02,"w":"or"},{"t":10.02,"w":"social"},{"t":10.02,"w":"sector,"},{"t